<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS BUY 207.26 MLN RAND SAFRICA BONDS FRI.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS BUY 207.26 MLN RAND SAFRICA BONDS FRI.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 207.26 million rands worth of South African bonds on Friday after selling 100.54 million on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
